        "Notes": "Farnese thanks the Academy for the epistle dedicated to him, and containing many orations of distinguished authors. Farnese also mentions Claudio Aleandro and one M[onsignor?] Silvio. Gonzaga thanks the Academy for the publication dedicated to him. The Duke of Savoy mentions that his ambassador Senator Malopera has reported the Academy`s expression of esteem for the Duke. Cardinal Madruzzo mentions that Abbot Marlupino delivered to him a volume with `versi heroici dei cardinali Sadoleto and Sfondrato frutti di cotesta rara Academia Venetiana alla quale piacque [...] dedicarmeli.` Madruzzo declares to have expressed his gratitude to his friend and academician Luca Contile. D`Este has received from Valerio Faenzi a letter from the Academy and the volume dedicated to him.",
